["er.eventlog.import-anchor/1",{"authority":{"logical_scope":"ess","stream_identity":"01a0cabe-67c1-7103-8e43-bb0ee2ca8073","tenant":"planning"},"completeness":"available_evidence_only","evidence":[],"instance":{"entity":"aep.entity","fields":{"document":{"events":[],"fields":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":0,"id":"MIGeb6e15e79e604f083330c99611ab5d1a5e4dde4fd43999e7108975729542dc29","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/interpreted-scenario-supplied-facts","provenance":{"created_by":"system","updated_by":"system"},"revision":3,"type":"aep.story/v1","updated_at":0}},"body":"# Story: a scenario supplies what the model does not determine\n\n## Outcome\n\nFour things the model does not decide come from the scenario, through the surfaces that already\nexist for them: an outcome declared `external:` through `configure_external_outcome`, the current\ntime through `mark_instant` and `observe_elapsed`, an identity nothing supplies by the interpreter\nminting one and the scenario binding it by name with `capture:`, and how a projection is stored by\nit not being observable at all.\n\nThe interpreter refuses to invent any of them. A scenario supplying what the model does not is what\na scenario is for.\n\n## Acceptance\n\nA scenario that scripts an `external:` outcome, claims a length of time, and binds a minted identity\nwith `capture:` reports the same result under `--target interpreted` as under `--target billing`,\nand a scenario that scripts none of them reports an unsatisfied obligation rather than an invented\nvalue.\n\n## Scope\n\nThe interpreter's `ConformanceTarget` hooks: `configure_external_outcome`, `mark_instant`,\n`observe_elapsed`, and identity minting. No new suite vocabulary.\n","owner":"ess","relations":[{"decomposes":"epic:model-driven-interpretation"},{"serves":"vision:O2"},{"depends_on":"story:interpreted-target-selection"}],"scope":[{"confidence":"cited","path":"crates/verify/ess-conformance"},{"confidence":"inferred","path":"crates/verify/ess-conformance/src/interpret.rs"},{"confidence":"cited","path":"crates/verify/ess-conformance/src/runner.rs"},{"confidence":"cited","path":"crates/verify/ess-conformance/src/scenario.rs"},{"confidence":"cited","path":"crates/verify/ess-conformance/src/target.rs"},{"confidence":"inferred","path":"crates/verify/ess-conformance/tests"}],"status":"draft","summary":"External outcomes, time and minted identities come from the scenario, never from the interpreter","tags":["priority-high"],"title":"A scenario supplies what the model does not determine"},"lifecycle_state":"draft"}},"id":"MIGeb6e15e79e604f083330c99611ab5d1a5e4dde4fd43999e7108975729542dc29","lifecycle_state":"recorded","revision":3,"version":1},"order":"per_kind_only","subject":["aep.entity","MIGeb6e15e79e604f083330c99611ab5d1a5e4dde4fd43999e7108975729542dc29"]}]